abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.6 adds Game Trees: Minimax and Alpha-Beta Pruning, a deterministic adversarial-search lab for recursive MIN/MAX backup, exact safe cutoffs, move-order work comparisons, and prediction-before-reveal challenges while preserving the v1.5.1 HCI, analytics, and Activity Pack hardening.
